{"synopsis":"Dari Author yang sama dengan Komik Legend of Star General\nQiao An dari kelas khusus Battle Armor Academy gagal dalam ujian kecocokan Battle Armor dan diturunkan ke kelas logistik di Akademi Luar\nTiga ratus tahun setelah kiamat dunia manusia menjadi terpecah belah\nQiao An seorang pemuda yang terbebani dengan hutang besar secara tak terduga menemukan bahwa dirinya telah membuat kontrak dengan lebih dari satu Battle Armor kelas atas\nHitam atau putih kamu pilih yang mana\nAku pilih semuanya\nDengan memegang Battle Armor terkuat menghasilkan uang menjadi hal yang mudah Menyelamatkan dunia\nTidak itu bukan urusanku\nApa\nPenghapusan semua hutang Eh tunggu","alternative_title":"钢铁契约","author":"乐想动漫","artist":"乐想动漫","chapters":[{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"36fab326-67d4-4597-ac63-97abbc042fdc","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2026-07-29"},{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"6c3e321a-b827-46a2-be73-08137e8e4cca","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-07-22"},{"number":"72","chapter":"72","slug":"ec658ce1-cf87-43ed-bc2b-740aad99cb66","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-06-23"},{"number":"71","chapter":"71","slug":"3069f0be-c3c1-4e78-ae7e-7c8aa92f62ef","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-06-11"},{"number":"70","chapter":"70","slug":"d5c0eb12-c853-44ea-a8fe-62b496d8c351","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-06-07"},{"number":"69","chapter":"69","slug":"61994710-4bbc-4a53-b6ce-81c513945fc3","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-06-07"},{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"74d685fc-7bdc-448b-acfa-9ef2ac748adf","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-06-07"},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"65d270c1-432c-4639-adc1-9e24bf349f22","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-05-25"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"cfffd2bb-372d-4783-8e4a-b5b5bfdb3133","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-05-24"},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"465097ea-4429-4628-85f4-7865bb253b32","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-05-12"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"945f02c1-8e35-4b0f-b85e-3eed329d44d